    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a sunk cost. i've put so much into this life and it has given me nothing back but this emptiness. if the \"game\" is just about losing everything eventually, why even stay in it? it feels like the only way to actually stop the pain and get that relief you're talking about is to just... exit. to just stop everything permanently.",
